### ---------- ML / model artifacts (large binary files) ----------
# Note: .pkl / .joblib files are intentionally NOT ignored — they're small
# enough to track in this repo (pricing model, encoders, PCA, embeddings).
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.h5
*.bin
*.safetensors
pricing_trained/

